\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Training pipeline. The multi-component reward supervises each rollout independently through format, table, accuracy, and length rewards. HCPC adds a group-level bonus computed over rollouts that pass the correct-path filter ($G^+$), rewarding consistent table extraction together with diverse reasoning. We compare two advantage estimators over the same per-rollout reward: standard GRPO and NSR, which masks the gradient of correct rollouts.}}{4}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{4}{Training pipeline. The multi-component reward supervises each rollout independently through format, table, accuracy, and length rewards. HCPC adds a group-level bonus computed over rollouts that pass the correct-path filter ($G^+$), rewarding consistent table extraction together with diverse reasoning. We compare two advantage estimators over the same per-rollout reward: standard GRPO and NSR, which masks the gradient of correct rollouts}{figure.caption.5}{}}
